// Package moves is pixelfx's moves category: whole attacks, wind-up to recovery, chained from the effects of the other categories and acted out by a character (pixelfx.Perform), each a pixelfx.Effect registered as "moves/<name>" when the package is imported.
//
// It holds the arrow shot, the earth stomp, the ground pound, the pistol shots and the rocket launcher. The category's other moves (dash strike, fireball throw, holy smite, ice lance throw, lightning call, meteor call and sword combo) chain effects of the arcane, fire, holy, ice, lightning and melee categories, and the impacts crit hit, that have not been ported yet, and follow once those are (see docs/en/pixelfx.md, "Porting a category").
package moves
